com/godotengine/godot/pull/102751#issuecomment-2654593528","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102751","id":2654593528,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eOeH4","user":{"login":"belzecue","id":1931303,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzEzMDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1931303?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/belzecue","html_url":"https://github.com/belzecue","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belzecue/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belzecue/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belzecue/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belzecue/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belzecue/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belzecue/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belzecue/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belzecue/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belzecue/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-12T18:59:41Z","updated_at":"2025-02-12T19:07:42Z","body":"The Project Settings \"Import Defaults\" tab uses a \"Reset to Defaults\" button.  The Editor Compilation Configuration Profile tool also uses \"Reset to Defaults\".  Still looking for other existing instances.\r\n\r\nShould this PR's \"**Revert** to Default\" button text follow those for UI consistency?\r\n\r\nUPDATE: Another is \"Manage Editor Feature Profiles\" which has a \"Reset to Default\" button (singular this time).","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2654593528/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2657416518","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102751#issuecomment-2657416518","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102751","id":2657416518,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eZPVG","user":{"login":"MajorMcDoom","id":13228932,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMjI4OTMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13228932?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom","html_url":"https://github.com/MajorMcDoom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-13T18:28:51Z","updated_at":"2025-02-13T18:28:51Z","body":"> The Project Settings \"Import Defaults\" tab uses a \"Reset to Defaults\" button. The Editor Compilation Configuration Profile tool also uses \"Reset to Defaults\". Still looking for other existing instances.\r\n> \r\n> Should this PR's \"**Revert** to Default\" button text follow those for UI consistency?\r\n> \r\n> UPDATE: Another is \"Manage Editor Feature Profiles\" which has a \"Reset to Default\" button (singular this time).\r\n\r\nI did make this change, just FYI. :)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2657416518/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2660639470","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102751#issuecomment-2660639470","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102751","id":2660639470,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eliLu","user":{"login":"MajorMcDoom","id":13228932,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMjI4OTMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13228932?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom","html_url":"https://github.com/MajorMcDoom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-15T02:23:17Z","updated_at":"2025-02-15T06:36:42Z","body":"> Tested locally, it works as expected.\r\n> \r\n> It makes sense to be able to commit default environment settings to version control, so that different team members in a project see the same thing when editing scenes with the preview environment.\r\n> \r\n>     * The **Reset to Default** buttons should be disabled when all properties are set to their default values.\r\n\r\n@Calinou \r\nI'm good with all of these changes _except_ adding awareness of revertability, which I'm hesitant about.\r\n\r\nThe preview settings are not implemented on top of a system that facilitates revertability, like for example Object properties. The only way to add that support now (without a major refactor) is to add a lot of repetitious and error-prone code that adds way more areas of maintenance. i.e. check every control against every global default. Any time someone wants to add/change/remove a preview setting, they have to now change code in yet another place. It's essentially making a non-scalable, in situ version of a property system.\r\n\r\nFurthermore, to function correctly, it also needs to subscribe to project settings changes, which means adding to the ever-growing amount of code that executes when project settings change.\r\n\r\nGiven all of the above, I'm not sure the gain (having the revert button disabled when pressing it would be redundant) is worth it.\r\n\r\nThat being said, I did go ahead and implement it. I also made it so that if there are currently _no_ changes in the preview settings popup, then changing the defaults in the project settings will also live-update the previews. It's neat, but again, this is essentially replicating the override feature of inspector properties in a not-so-consistent way. My recommendation is we just leave this part out for now and merge the rest of your suggestions, but let me know what you think!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2660639470/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2660987167","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102751#issuecomment-2660987167","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102751","id":2660987167,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6em3Ef","user":{"login":"MajorMcDoom","id":13228932,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMjI4OTMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13228932?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom","html_url":"https://github.com/MajorMcDoom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-15T16:12:38Z","updated_at":"2025-02-15T16:12:38Z","body":"Worked in some of the feedback, and now the popup looks like this:\r\n![Untitled-1](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/945c404f-b2cf-4e64-a93d-45fa7b1ffbd8)\r\n\r\nNote that I've also removed the \"Angular\" qualifier from the Altitude label. There's already a degree symbol, and none of the rest of the docs have this qualifier either, so it's better to be consistent.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2660987167/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]